se second coordinate belongs to $B.$\n\nIn this case, the schematic for $A\\times B$ is shown below.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14072443/assets/c660ff6d042bdf228387e5ad55651f02b136f738a2e4fa99c3ef3b3faef3e3c5.png)\n\nHence, the set $C=A\\times B$ is given by\n\n$$\nC={(k,-1),(k,3),(k,5),(m,-1),(m,3),(m,5)}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"III only.\"" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-182009/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "a6128eca-7f76-5386-9d67-d81db2943eeb"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-182009"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-105860/selection/a20b3c9808c291c56ec5bfc5f0f93a856fc692714ca7ebd36c5e4bc361f7075c" :answer/id #uuid "344eca20-bc9d-5d53-bfe9-f6a6e5f0574f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "42" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-105860/selection/d472470bf61b62667bf520b42074414f07d1266def1002f8f8325fe27d872b2d" :answer/id #uuid "dc655e68-1b98-5672-90d3-75e85e7efbb3" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "39" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-105860/selection/12b7d840a997b0af25896f37c76d366155c72a970c1525c62ec119b69786f393" :answer/id #uuid "3cecf941-ed62-590a-90ec-558991353b6a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "13" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-105860/selection/a38ef12f135c1e6010d68ed21f81bc27372a73a756455b7066f6182c46018cc8" :answer/id #uuid "20c3c46a-b6b0-534c-9221-6170a42d6623" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "32" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-105860/selection/713bb3b087b31554fba8b48520fba2f9d4d353e9b2d87f3d41c293daf48e1776" :answer/id #uuid "0c909e9d-aa07-5991-a31a-8c8435a6e49e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "36" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-105860/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "72cb44ac-5bc8-5b8d-97e0-61ebfde37489" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :ans